四六時中 帰りの会で
Every single time at the wrap-up meet,

3
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:57,350
面倒くささを押し付けられてる
the annoyances passed on to me,

4
00:04:57,350 --> 00:04:59,600
何から何まで
from start to finish,

5
